  "body": "Supersedes #2038\n\nGitHub closed #2038 when its parent #2027 merged and its base branch was deleted. This PR has the same branch.\n\n## Merge of main\n\n- `git merge origin/main` was clean (no conflicts).\n- After the merge, two pinning tests failed. Main added 18 geometry settings (operation tabs, browser tree, `font_label_min`, `highlight_stroke_px`). Main also changed the dark default of `font_caption` from 12.5 to 10.0.\n- Commit d660d3342 adds each new setting with its dark default to `assets/themes/theme.json.example`. It also adds the rows to the table in `docs/user-guide/themes.md`, with the range from `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme/clamp.rs`.\n- Main does not compile `camcraft-ui` at this time: `crates/ui/src/machine_modes.rs` `short_caption` has no arm for `MachineKind::Waterjet` (E0004). This PR does not fix that. For the test run, I added the arm locally and did not commit it.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Add `assets/themes/theme.json.example`. It holds each colour and each geometry setting of the theme format, with its dark default value. This includes the ribbon keys of #2027.\n- Add `docs/user-guide/themes.md`. It names the file, says how to make a theme from it, and has a table of each setting with its meaning and range.\n- Add `crates/ui/tests/theme_example.rs`. `theme_files.rs` is at 400 lines, so the tests have their own file.\n- Add `docs/decisions/2025-theme-example.md`.\n\nThe test reads the key set from `COLOR_NAMES` and `GEOM_NAMES` in the loader. It keeps no second list.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `example_has_exactly_the_loader_keys`: fails for a key in the code and not in the file, and for the reverse.\n- `example_loads_and_holds_the_dark_defaults`: the file loads with no notes and equals `Tokens::DARK`.\n- `example_is_not_listed_as_a_theme`: the discovery walk lists `.json` files only.\n\nResult on d660d3342 (with the local Waterjet arm): `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test theme_example`: 3 passed. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No GUI run. The UI look does not change, so there are no screenshots. No snapshot PNG changed.\n- Look-and-feel numbers that are fixed in the UI code and are not theme settings are out of scope. Issue #2025 gets a comment about them only if found.\n\nProcess change: no\n\nChangelog: Add `assets/themes/theme.json.example` that lists each theme setting with its default value, and a user guide page on how to make a theme.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2025\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
